h\u001b[21Gwake\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G  \u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;246mUses Claude Code's --dangerously-load-development-channels flag. It shows a warning screen at every start\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Ba\u001b[8Gd\u001b[10Gl\u001b[12Gts\u001b[15Ga non-allowlisted \u001b[34Glug\u001b[38Gn push\u001b[45Gm\u001b[47Gssage\u001b[54Gi\u001b[56Gto the ses\u001b[67Gion.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246m3\u001b[6G\u001b[39mT\u001b[8Gam or\u001b[14GEnterprise\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246mThe wake needs \u001b[22Gn admin to enabl\u001b[39G \u001b[42Gann\u001b[46Gls\u001b[53Gallow mas\u001b[63G. I'd check /status and managed settings.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B4\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[39m5\u001b[30;1H\u001b[19;1H"]
